   "accessed": "2026-11-22",
   "note": "A check: the CN-235's printed length (70.21 ft, 21.40 m) and span (84.7 ft, 25.82 m), its main gear track (153.5 in, 3.90 m: the brochure's 3.9 m) and wheelbase (272.5 in, 6.92 m: the brochure labels 6.20 m and draws 7.25 m)."
  },
  {
