   "title": "USCG HC-144B 2311 at Opa-locka, 2023-01-18, right side (Colin Cooke, CC BY-SA 2.0)",
   "accessed": "2026-11-22",
   "note": "A check only (only measurements are taken): flipped nose-left and fitted at the nose, tail cone, the fin's top trailing corner and the fuselage's height 3 and 16.7 m back (tools/photo_trace.py), the outline lands on the nose, crown, belly, the fin's leading and trailing edges and its top within about 2-12 px (under 0.1 m). It shows the HC-144's two cabin windows a side and the radome under the forward fuselage."
